      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Set each app&#x27;s volume from 0 to 200%, or mute it</li><li>Send any app to its own output, like music to the speakers and calls to AirPods</li><li>Other apps fade down automatically while you&#x27;re on a call</li><li>Scroll over an app to adjust it, or use ⌃⌥⌘↑ / ⌃⌥⌘↓ / ⌃⌥⌘M for the app in front</li><li>Live level meters, smooth fades, and a soft limiter so boosted audio stays clean</li><li>Automatic updates</li></ul>]]></description>
